  section.home-templates.page-shell.section(aria-labelledby="template-title")
    .home-section-heading
      .home-section-heading__copy
        p.eyebrow Starting points
        h2#template-title Start with the page you need.
        p Every template shares the same tokens, spacing rhythm, and accessible behaviors. You never reinvent the design as your pages grow.
      a.ui-link(href=route("legacy.templates")) All templates →
    .home-template-grid
      article.home-template-card
        .home-template-card__preview.home-template-card__preview--library(aria-hidden="true")
          i UI
          i UI
          i UI
          i UI
        .home-template-card__body
          .ui-cluster
            span.ui-pill System
            span.ui-pill Docs
          h3
            a(href=route("legacy.components")) UI Library
          p Consolidate components, states, and HTML5 examples into a single reference.
          a.ui-link(href=route("legacy.components")) Open library →
      article.home-template-card
        .home-template-card__preview.home-template-card__preview--dashboard(aria-hidden="true")
          i
          .home-template-card__dash-main
            b
            span
            span
            span
            span
        .home-template-card__body
          .ui-cluster
            span.ui-pill Business
            span.ui-pill Data
          h3
            a(href=route("legacy.dashboard")) Dashboard
          p Organize KPIs, activity, data tables, and quick actions in a unified view.
          a.ui-link(href=route("legacy.dashboard")) Open dashboard →
      article.home-template-card
        .home-template-card__preview.home-template-card__preview--store(aria-hidden="true")
          i
          i
          i
        .home-template-card__body
          .ui-cluster
            span.ui-pill Commerce
            span.ui-pill Product
          h3
            a(href=route("legacy.commerce")) Storefront
          p Build product discovery, filtering, cart, and quick-view customer flows.
          a.ui-link(href=route("legacy.commerce")) Open store →
      article.home-template-card
        .home-template-card__preview.home-template-card__preview--marketing(aria-hidden="true")
          b
          i
          i
          i
          i
        .home-template-card__body
          .ui-cluster
            span.ui-pill Content
            span.ui-pill Growth
          h3
            a(href=route("legacy.marketing")) Marketing
          p Tell your story with hero sections, pricing tiers, social proof, and FAQs.
          a.ui-link(href=route("legacy.marketing")) Open landing →
      article.home-template-card
        .home-template-card__preview.home-template-card__preview--auth(aria-hidden="true")
          i
          span
          span
          b
        .home-template-card__body
          .ui-cluster
            span.ui-pill Auth
            span.ui-pill Flow
          h3
            a(href=route("legacy.auth.login")) Auth flows
          p Connect sign in, registration, and password recovery flows consistently.
          a.ui-link(href=route("legacy.auth.login")) Open flows →
      article.home-template-card
        .home-template-card__preview.home-template-card__preview--docs(aria-hidden="true")
          b
          i
